**English Version**

The data for this competition includes operation sequence logs of users from an online game over a one-month period, aiming to distinguish between retained users and churned users through these sequences.

Files
train.csv - Training dataset

submit_sample.csv - Sample submission file

Columns
train.csv
ID - Unique identifier for the user

Timestamp - Timestamp of the user's operation (Note: The time zone should be converted to UTC+8. The first log entry is at 2018-09-21 00:00:00, and the last entry is at 2018-10-20 23:59:59.)

ActionType - Type of operation

ActionId - Unique identifier for the operation (For example, in a game context: clicking a dungeon button, talking to an NPC, obtaining a ladder ranking, etc.)

label - The number of days the user logs in within the next seven days. This is not provided in the dataset, and participants need to construct the label themselves: if there is an operation record for the user on a given day, it indicates a valid login for that day; otherwise, it is considered no login.

