9340,ai-2-dl-for-nlp-2025-homework-2,"# Overview

In this homework you have to develop a *classifier using deep neural networks* with the given dataset, using **PyTorch** and **word2vec** word embeddings.

Your classifier should be **binary** and deal with the **positive** and the **negative** class.

For a detailed description, please refer to the PDF available on eClass.
----------------------
# Evaluation

On Kaggle, the evaluation metric must be **accuracy**, while for the report you should evaluate your classifier using **accuracy**, **precision, recall** and **F1-score**, with the toolkit Scikit-Learn (https://scikit-learn.org/stable/).","# Dataset Description

You will work with three subsets of the dataset: **train_dataset**, **val_dataset**, and **test_dataset**, which are used for training, validation, and testing, respectively.  Each one consists of three columns:

- **ID** : A unique identifier for each tweet.
- **Text** : The content of the tweet.
- **Label** : A binary value where **0** represents a **negative** sentiment and **1**  represents a **positive** sentiment.

Additionally, there is a file called **sample_submission.csv**, which serves as a template for submissions. It provides an example of the required format for the submission CSV file.",False,True
