The goal of the competition is to practice what you have learned in your class. The objective is to develop a model that can accurately predict an unknown variable based on the provided features. The competition is open to all students enrolled in the course and serves as an introduction to Kaggle and practical machine learning


#Recommandation
This competition serves as an opportunity to apply and practice advanced regression techniques. It is suggested to begin with Exploratory Data Analysis to gain insight into the data and then to use various regularized regression techniques and sophisticated machine learning models to make predictions. 
