**Total Prizes: 5,625 USDC**

- ?? 1st Place ¨C 3,000 USDC  
- ?? 2nd Place ¨C 1,500 USDC  
- ?? 3rd Place ¨C 750 USDC  
- ??? 4th Place ¨C 375 USDC",,False,True
