# Important Rules


1. **Open-Source Models Only**  
   You are only allowed to use **open-weight models** in your solution. The use of proprietary, paid, or closed-source models is strictly prohibited. Violation of this rule will result in **disqualification**.

2. **Code Sharing Requirement (Top 5)**  
   To promote transparency and learning, participants who finish in the **Top 5** on the private leaderboard are required to publicly share their **full training and inference code** that can reproduce their final score.  
