3. **No Duplicate Accounts**  
   The use of **duplicate or multiple accounts** is strictly prohibited. It can be easily discovered by the host. This will be actively monitored and violations will result in **immediate disqualification**.

4. **Prize Eligibility**  
   Prizes will be awarded **only to participants residing in Saudi Arabia**. If you are not a resident of Saudi Arabia, you are welcome to participate for learning and leaderboard placement, but you will not be eligible for monetary prizes.

5. **Manual Annotation of Test Set Is Prohibited**  
   Manually labeling or annotating the test set (e.g., by reading and assigning topics by hand) is strictly **not allowed**. Any indication of manual labeling will result in **disqualification** This also includes closed sourced automatic LLM labeling.",,False,True
