3. **6.036?Introduction to Machine Learning**  
   - MIT OpenCourseWare course with video lectures and assignments on core ML algorithms.
   - MIT OCW ¡¤ Undergraduate level  
   - Link: https://ocw.mit.edu/courses/6-036-introduction-to-machine-learning-fall-2020/  



### 2. Soil Science & Agronomy  
4. **Sustainable Agricultural Land Management**  
   - Covers land and nutrient management strategies, water quality, and best management practices (BMPs).
   - Coursera ¡¤ University of Florida ¡¤ 8?weeks 
   - Link: https://www.coursera.org/learn/sustainable-agriculture  

5. **Agroforestry?III: Principles of Plant and Soil Management**  
   - Explores plant-soil interactions and sustainable agroforestry practices.
   - Coursera ¡¤ University of Florida ¡¤ 4?weeks 
   - Link: https://www.coursera.org/learn/agroforestry3  


### 3. Spatial Analysis & Remote Sensing  
