   - Introduction to spatial data, mapping, and ArcGIS workflows.
   - Coursera ¡¤ University of California, Davis ¡¤ 4?weeks 
   - Link: https://www.coursera.org/learn/gis  

7. **Introduction to Remote Sensing and Visible RS**  
   - TU?Delft lecture series on satellite principles, image analysis, and classification.
   - TU?Delft OCW ¡¤ Undergraduate level 
   - Link: https://ocw.tudelft.nl/course-lectures/introduction-to-remote-sensing-and-visible-rs/  


### 4. Precision Agriculture & Environmental Data  
