   - Strategies for managing water, soil, and land resources at scale.
   - Coursera ¡¤ Technical University of Denmark (DTU)  
   - Link: https://www.coursera.org/learn/global-environmental-management  

9. **Geospatial Science: Remote Sensing**  
   - Basics of airborne imaging, multispectral data, SAR, and photogrammetry.
   - edX ¡¤ University of Alaska Fairbanks ¡¤ 4?weeks
   - Link: https://www.edx.org/course/geospatial-science-remote-sensing  


### 5. Statistical & Programming Foundations  
