    - MIT OCW ¡¤ Undergraduate level  
    - Link: https://ocw.mit.edu/courses/18-05-introduction-to-probability-and-statistics-spring-2022/ 


**Tip:** Combine soil-chemistry feature engineering (ppm¡úkg/ha) with spatial/temporally derived indices (e.g. NDVI time series, GIS buffers), then apply robust cross-validation to avoid leakage (e.g., grouping by farm).

Happy learning¡ªand best of luck building your nutrient-gap models!




