Task Description

Detailed submission in 
https://www.kaggle.com/code/eenysh/fid-computing-and-submission?kernelSessionId=238182542

Participants are required to develop the generative AI that generate the hyperspectral images of disease infected crop by prompt of given disease ratio.

The training data and evaluation data are classified into 10 disease level, percentage intervals of 10% each:

¡¤ Level 1: 0¨C10%

¡¤ Level 2: 10¨C20%

¡¤ Level 3: 20¨C30%

¡¤ ...

¡¤ Level 10: 90¨C100%

For each disease level, participants must:

2. Generate 50 new images corresponding to the number of evaluation images, maintaining the target class characteristics.

3. Calculate the Fr¨¦chet Inception Distance (FID) between the generated images and the evaluation images for each class.

Submission Format

