| `Utilities`            | Type of utilities available (e.g., AllPub, NoSewr, NoSeWa, ELO).               |
| `Lot Config`           | Lot configuration (e.g., Inside, Corner, CulDSac, FR2, FR3).                   |
| `Land Slope`           | Slope of the property (e.g., Gtl, Mod, Sev).                                   |
