# Submission Instructions

Your submission must be a [Kaggle Writeup](https://www.kaggle.com/competitions/meta-kaggle-hackathon/projects) and it must be attached to this page. To create a new Writeup, click on the ""New Writeup"" button [here](https://www.kaggle.com/competitions/meta-kaggle-hackathon/projects). After you have saved your Writeup, you should see a ""Submit"" button in the top right corner. Each team is limited to submitting only a single Writeup, but that same Writeup can be un-submitted, edited, and re-submitted as many times as you'd like. Your Writeup should contain a summary of your overall project along with links to supporting resources. 

Note: If you attach a private Kaggle Resource to your public Kaggle Writeup, your private Resource will automatically be made public after the deadline.",,True,False
