## Output Format

Please submit your results in CSV format with two columns `id`, and `spoiler`. There should be one line corresponding to each input instance.

Each line in the CSV file should have the following format: ```<ID>```,```<SPOILER>```

where:
* ```<ID>``` is the id of the input instance in the test set.
