## Evaluation
We will use the Meteor score to evaluate the classifier's performance for task 2.

## Acknowledgements
We thank the [original competition](https://pan.webis.de/semeval23/pan23-web/clickbait-challenge.html#) hosts for providing the datasets.
----------------------
