©¦       ©À©¤©¤ test_001.jpg  
©¦       ©¸©¤©¤ ¡­ (121 images in total)  
©¦  
©¸©¤©¤ labels ¨C contains annotations in the form of polygons and masks  
    ©À©¤©¤ train  
    ©¦   ©À©¤©¤ p001_F_32_001_masks  
    ©¦   ©¦   ©À©¤©¤ 00_class_2.png  
    ©¦   ©¦   ©À©¤©¤ 01_class_5.png  
