As in sample.csv file

<p><strong>For each sample object</strong> the response (submission) must contain two numbers: target, Id.

</p><p>The first line of the file should contain the names of the columns and then the numbers separated by a comma:</p>
<pre>target, Id<br>1,0<br>1,1<br>0,2<br>1,3<br></pre>","# Dataset Description

