### Overview

??n v?i **FDS Summer Challenge 2025 - Weather Prediction**, b?n s? ???c th? s?c v?i m?t b¨¤i to¨¢n **phan lo?i nh? phan** tr¨ºn t?p d? li?u li¨ºn quan ??n **th?i ti?t v¨¤ kh¨ª h?u** ¡ª m?t ch? ?? kh¨¢ hi?m g?p trong m?i tr??ng h?c ???ng. Cu?c thi l¨¤ c? h?i tuy?t v?i ?? b?n kh¨¢m ph¨¢ th¨ºm v? c¨¢c l?nh v?c m?i trong khoa h?c d? li?u.  
