---

### Evaluation

K?t qu? ???c ?¨¢nh gi¨¢ b?ng **Matthews Correlation Coefficient c¨® tr?ng s? theo t?ng v? tr¨ª ??a ly (weighted MCC):**

$$
\text{wMCC} = \frac{1}{|\mathcal{X}|} \sum_{X \in \mathcal{X}} 
\frac{
\text{TP}(X) \cdot \text{TN}(X) - \text{FP}(X) \cdot \text{FN}(X)
}{
(\text{TP}(X) + \text{FP}(X)) \cdot
(\text{TP}(X) + \text{FN}(X)) \cdot
(\text{TN}(X) + \text{FP}(X)) \cdot
(\text{TN}(X) + \text{FN}(X))^{1/2}
}
$$

Trong ?¨®:  
- `X` l¨¤ m?t v? tr¨ª ??a ly x¨¢c ??nh (theo `row`, `col`)  
- `TP(X)` l¨¤ s? l??ng d? ?o¨¢n d??ng ?¨²ng t?i v? tr¨ª `X`  
- `TN(X)` l¨¤ s? l??ng d? ?o¨¢n am ?¨²ng t?i v? tr¨ª `X`  
- `FP(X)` l¨¤ s? l??ng d??ng sai (false positive) t?i v? tr¨ª `X`  
- `FN(X)` l¨¤ s? l??ng am sai (false negative) t?i v? tr¨ª `X`

**?u ?i?m c?a wMCC:**

- ?o l??ng can b?ng h?n khi d? li?u m?t can ??i (v¨ª d? 100:1)  
- Can nh?c c? 4 y?u t? TP, TN, FP, FN  
- Thang ?o t? -1 ??n 1, d? phan t¨ªch ch?t l??ng m? h¨¬nh  
- Cho ph¨¦p ?¨¢nh gi¨¢ ri¨ºng t?ng v¨´ng ??a ly

### So s¨¢nh nhanh F1 vs MCC

| Case        | TP | FP | FN | F1   | MCC  | Ghi ch¨²                  |
|-----------------|----|----|----|------|------|---------------------------|
| ?o¨¢n t?t        | 50 | 10 | 10 | 0.83 | 0.83 | Can b?ng, ?n ??nh         |
| L?ch d??ng      | 10 | 90 | 10 | 0.17 | 0.09 | Nhi?u FP, MCC gi?m r?     |
| L?ch am         | 10 | 10 | 90 | 0.17 | 0.09 | Nhi?u FN, gi?ng l?ch d??ng|
| Ch? ?¨²ng 1 m?u  | 1  | 0  | 0  | 0.67 | 0.10 | F1 ?o cao, MCC th?c t? h?n|
| B? s¨®t to¨¤n b?  | 0  | 0  |100 | 0.00 | 0.00 | C? F1 & MCC ??u b?ng 0    |
| ?o¨¢n sai to¨¤n b?| 10 | 90 | 90 | 0.10 | -0.09| MCC am, m? h¨¬nh r?t t?    |

