# Organizers Team ?

The competition is organized on behalf of ESA (Evridiki Ntagiou) by [MI Space Team from Warsaw University of Technology](http://credibleai.eu/) (Przemys?aw Biecek, Artur Janicki, Agata Kaczmarek and Dawid P?udowski) and [KPLabs](https://www.kplabs.space) (Krzysztof Kotowski and Ramez Shendy). 
