360+x captures real-world environments from four synchronised viewpoints (360¡ã panoramic, binocular egocentric, monocular egocentric, third-person front) together with 6-channel spatial audio, GPS, weather and text metadata. The dataset is designed to study how an embodied agent could perceive, localise actions and recognise scenes when immersed in a space, while also observing itself from an external vantage.",False,True
9865,bin-ego-360-challenge-classification-ext,"# Overview

![](https://www.googleapis.com/download/storage/v1/b/kaggle-user-content/o/inbox%2F16342273%2F54806d6ca5c3298b740c930a9360103f%2FScreenshot%202025-05-30%20at%2013.49.19.png?generation=1748609376448475&alt=media)

