# What's Next

With the conclusion of the Daxinzhuang pottery puzzle challenge, we have received submissions from participants worldwide. As an exploratory challenge, we are delighted to see diverse perspectives and innovative solutions from all participants. Over the next month, we will conduct meticulous manual comparisons of the submissions. Once all assembly work is completed, detailed scoring results will be promptly released.

*Since kaggle cannot view submission files, we will use the files submitted to h690@uic.edu.cn as the standard.*

