Q: **Why do I get the error `Submission must have **** rows` when submitting the CSV?**   
A: This error means your CSV file does not contain the correct number of rows. Your file must include every image from the shred_images folder exactly once. For any image you couldn't assemble, please place it in a dedicated assembly group (e.g., AssemblyGroup_failed).


