Q: **Why does my submission show a score of 0?**   
A: This is a challenge-based competition where you are solving a novel problem. We do not have the complete data for all pottery fragments to enable real-time evaluation. Therefore, the scores currently displayed on the leaderboard are inaccurate. The final scoring will be performed uniformly after the competition concludes, and the results will be announced.

