1.You need to register from **'Join the membership'** button. ![](https://www.googleapis.com/download/storage/v1/b/kaggle-user-content/o/inbox%2F28059272%2F9dd0a07bb64c5a52ece36787ad47431f%2FSAI_gateway_join_membership_page.png?generation=1753833294161562&alt=media)
