1.  Once you've registered and logged in to [ScienceON API Gateway](https://scienceon.kisti.re.kr/apigateway/api/main/mainForm.do), you need to click **'Application for use'**. ![](https://www.googleapis.com/download/storage/v1/b/kaggle-user-content/o/inbox%2F28059272%2F62924f0b543724bfd72f455ba3a47081%2FSAI_gateway_checking_key_page.png?generation=1753833414434284&alt=media)
You can see especially your **'Authentication key'**, **'Client ID'**and **'Application IP address'** in there. **Those three information are the main information that you will use during execution of SAI RAG baseline.**




??**How to Execute the SAI RAG Baseline**
1. You can install related libraries and set your own conda environment by following the given command which is located in **Data** section, under the `rdgenai-api-sample` folder:
