Proton is a small, but quickly growing, B2B provider of technology products and services. The CEO recently decided to expand into the Kansas City market, and has asked you to hire a new Area Sales Manager to oversee accounts in that region. Below is a job description your HR partner has drafted and used in his online posting. He has also coordinated with Proton¡¯s HR vendors to provide data from a variety of selection tests Proton has approved for use. Finally, you will notice that HR has already asked three interviewers to review the video interviews provided by each candidate.

You also have access to hiring data from last year¡¯s new employees, which you may use as you determine how to rank applicants. Your goal is to predict applicants¡¯ performance as accurately as possible.
----------------------
# Evaluation

Submissions are evaluated using Kaggle's [mean squared error (MSE) metric.](https://www.kaggle.com/code/shreyatiwari/mse-rmse)","# Dataset Description

