<li><strong>zipcode</strong> - candidate zip code</li>
<li><strong>openness</strong> - openness from NEO inventory</li>
<li><strong>conscientiousness</strong> - conscientiousness from NEO inventory</li>
<li><strong>extraversion</strong> - extraversion from NEO inventory</li>
<li><strong>agreeableness</strong> - agreeableness from NEO inventory</li>
<li><strong>intelligence.test</strong> - wonderlic test results</li>
<li><strong>gpa</strong> - most recently available grade point average </li>
