9973,ninja-neural-nets-team-test,"# Overview

Welcome to the **Ninja Neural Nets Team Test** ¡ª a simple and fun challenge designed for anyone who wants to learn, experiment, and join our growing ML community.

This competition is **beginner-friendly**, but still gives you room to try creative ideas, build clean notebooks, and compare your solutions with others.
Whether you're new to machine learning or already experienced, this is your chance to practice, improve, and become part of the Ninja squad.

Submit your predictions, share your notebooks, and enjoy the challenge.
If you¡¯d like feedback or want to meet other learners, join our community below.

---

# ?? **Ninja Neural Nets Community**

Join the squad, share notebooks, and learn together:

