# ?? Congratulations, Seeker  

Congratulations, Seeker. Your senses are sharp, and you have successfully **identified the legends** hiding in plain sight. ??  
Now, with your potential team assembled, you face a terrifying truth about this world: **there are no Pok¨¦mon Centers.**  
Every battle is a duel to the end, and when a Pok¨¦mon is defeated, it is **gone... forever.** ??  

The bond you forge with your Pok¨¦mon is a fragile one, and **victory is the only thing that can protect it.**  

---

You cannot afford to be reckless. Before you send your trusted companion into the arena, you must be **certain of the outcome.**  
Your next challenge is to become a **grandmaster of strategy, a seer of combat.**  

Using a dataset chronicling **thousands of past duels**, you must build a model that can **predict the winner** of any given fight.  
?? Analyze the combatants, weigh their strengths and weaknesses, and **calculate the odds.**  

---

This tool will be your **guide, your crystal ball ??**, helping you navigate the **high-stakes world of Pok¨¦mon battles**  
where the price of failure is **absolute. ??**

----------------------
# Evaluation

In the heat of battle, there is no room for ambiguity¡ªthere is only a winner and a loser. Therefore, submissions for this round will be judged on **Categorical Accuracy**. This metric is straightforward and unforgiving: it measures the percentage of battles where your model correctly predicted the victor. Every correct prediction is a Pok¨¦mon saved; every failure is a potential loss. Strive for the highest accuracy, as your team's very survival depends on the precision of your predictions.","# Dataset Description

# ?? The Duelist's Prophecy  

