Then, the trained model will then accurately predict bounding boxes for **real-world images**.  
The model¡¯s performance is evaluated based on [**mAP@50**.](https://falcon.duality.ai/secure/documentation/ex3-colab-testing-output?sidebarMode=learn&utm_source=kaggle&utm_medium=kaggle_competition&utm_campaign=competition_fk1#the-meaning-of-50-in-m-ap-50)   

