10083,stocks-return-prediction-v-3,"# Overview

Use the given features to predict future return.
----------------------
# Description

You will get 2 dataset (training set and test set). Use the training set to train your model and predict with the features data in the test set.

When you think you've got a pretty good version, you can submit it. Everyone can submit repeatedly, with no limit on the number of submissions.
----------------------
# Evaluation

