### 3. Hu?n luy?n M? h¨¬nh

* ¨¢p d?ng c¨¢c thu?t to¨¢n h?c m¨¢y ?? h?c: Decision Tree, RandomForest, Logistic Regression, SVM, v.v.
* C¨® th? m? r?ng sang ensemble (XGBoost, LightGBM, ¡­).
* Train **ri¨ºng bi?t** tr¨ºn d? li?u t? **Lu?ng A** v¨¤ **Lu?ng B**.

### 4. ?¨¢nh gi¨¢ v¨¤ Phan t¨ªch K?t qu?

* D¨´ng ch? s? ph¨´ h?p:

  * Phan lo?i: Accuracy, Precision, Recall, F1, ROC-AUC.
  * H?i quy (n?u c¨®): RMSE, MAE, R2.
* L?p b?ng so s¨¢nh hi?u su?t gi?a 2 lu?ng ??c tr?ng.

### 5. So s¨¢nh v¨¤ K?t lu?n

* Phan t¨ªch ?u ¨C nh??c ?i?m c?a t?ng lu?ng.
* ??a ra k?t lu?n: Lu?ng n¨¤o t?t h?n cho b¨¤i to¨¢n?
* Gi?i th¨ªch v¨¬ sao (v¨ª d?: Autoencoder gi¨²p n¨¦n th?ng tin nh?ng c¨® th? m?t interpretability).

---

## ?? L?u y

* Ch? s? d?ng d? li?u ???c cung c?p (kh?ng d¨´ng external data).
