   * N?u d¨´ng Transfer Learning: fine-tune c¨¢c layer cu?i v¨¤ th¨ºm fully connected layer m?i.

5. **?¨¢nh gi¨¢ & N?p k?t qu?**

   * Metric: **Accuracy** + phan t¨ªch b?ng **Confusion Matrix**.
   * N?p file **submission.csv** c¨® format:

```csv
