...","# Dataset Description

?? Dataset Description

This dataset contains a collection of SMS messages that are labeled as ham (normal messages) or spam (unwanted/rubbish messages).
The goal of the competition is to build a classifier that can automatically distinguish between spam and ham SMS messages.

?? Files

train.csv ¨C Training set containing SMS messages and their labels.

test.csv ¨C Test set with SMS messages but without labels (participants must predict these).

sample_submission.csv ¨C A sample submission file in the correct format. Participants must follow this format when submitting predictions.

solution.csv ¨C Ground truth labels for the test set (hidden during the competition, used only for scoring).

?? Columns
train.csv

label ¨C The label of the SMS message:

0 ¡ú Ham (normal message)

1 ¡ú Spam (unwanted message)

message ¨C The raw text content of the SMS.

