# ?? Dataset Description ¡ª DetReIDX

The **DetReIDX** dataset is a *multi-session, multi-view* benchmark for **video-based person re-identification** across **aerial (UAV)** and **ground/indoor** cameras.  
It was collected at **seven universities** spanning **Portugal, Turkey, India, and Angola**, with each identity recorded on **different days** (S1, S2) to introduce *natural variation in clothing, lighting, and location*.  
All identities are consistently labeled across sessions and annotated with **16 soft-biometric attributes**.

