#### ?? Social and economic indicators
- `emp.var.rate` ¡ª employment variation rate  
- `cons.price.idx` ¡ª consumer price index  
- `cons.conf.idx` ¡ª consumer confidence index  
- `euribor3m` ¡ª euribor 3-month rate  
- `nr.employed` ¡ª number of employees  

#### ?? Target variable
- `y` ¡ª did the client subscribe to a term deposit?  
  (`1 = yes`, `0 = no`)

