)
```

## 5. »­Ïñ¥Ç©`¥¿Õi¤ßÞz¤ß¤ÎÔO¶¨

ImageDataGenerator¤òÊ¹ÓÃ¤·¤Æ£¬Ñ§Á•ÓÃ¤È—ÊÔ^ÓÃ¤Î»­Ïñ¥Ç©`¥¿¤òÕi¤ßÞz¤à¤³¤È¤Ë¤·¤Þ¤¹£®»­Ïñ¥µ¥¤¥º¤ò150x150£¬¥Ð¥Ã¥Á¥µ¥¤¥º¤ò32¤ËÔO¶¨¤·¤Þ¤¹£®
¤³¤³¤Ç¤Ï¥Ç©`¥¿’ˆ�ˆ¤ÏÈë¤Ã¤Æ¤¤¤Þ¤»¤ó¤¬£¬±ØÒª¤Ê¤éÈë¤ì¤Æ¤¯¤À¤µ¤¤£¨¤¿¤À¤·£¬zoomµÈ¤ÎÔO¶¨‚Ž¤òÒŠÖ±¤¹±ØÒª¤¬¤¢¤ê¤½¤¦¤Ç¤¹£©£®

```
from keras.src.legacy.preprocessing.image import ImageDataGenerator

# parameters
img_size = 150
batch_size = 32

# Train data
train_dir = ""/kaggle/temp/janken/train""
train_image_generator_aug = ImageDataGenerator(
    rescale=1./255,
)
train_data_gen_aug = train_image_generator_aug.flow_from_directory(
    train_dir,
    target_size=(img_size, img_size),
    batch_size=batch_size,
    class_mode=""categorical""
)
print(train_data_gen_aug.class_indices)

# Validation data
validation_dir = ""/kaggle/temp/janken/val""
validation_image_generator = ImageDataGenerator(rescale=1./255)
val_data_gen = validation_image_generator.flow_from_directory(
    batch_size=batch_size,
    directory=validation_dir,
    shuffle=False,
    target_size=(img_size, img_size),
    class_mode=""categorical"")
```

## 6. ¥â¥Ç¥ë¤ÎÔOÓ‹

»­Ïñ·Öî�¤Î¤¿¤á¤Î¥â¥Ç¥ë¤òÔOÓ‹¤·¤Þ¤¹£®
¤³¤³¤Ç¤Ï¥·¥ó¥×¥ë¤ÊCNN¤òÊ¹¤¤¤Þ¤¹£®£¨ßmÒË¤è¤êÁ¼¤¤¤â¤Î¤Ë‰ä¸ü¤·¤Æ¤¯¤À¤µ¤¤£©

```
from keras import Sequential
from keras.layers import Conv2D, MaxPooling2D
from keras.layers import GlobalAveragePooling2D, Dense
from keras.optimizers import Adam

model = Sequential([
    Conv2D(32, (3,3), activation='relu', input_shape=(img_size, img_size, 3)),
    MaxPooling2D(2, 2),
    Conv2D(64, (3,3), activation='relu'),
    GlobalAveragePooling2D(),
    Dense(1024, activation='relu'),
    Dense(3, activation='softmax')
])
model.compile(optimizer=Adam(learning_rate=0.0005), loss='categorical_crossentropy', metrics=['accuracy'])
```

## 7. ¥â¥Ç¥ë¤ÎÑ§Á•

Ñ§Á•ÓÃ¥Ç©`¥¿¤òÓÃ¤¤¤Æ×÷³É¤·¤¿¥â¥Ç¥ë¤òÑ§Á•¤·¤Þ¤¹£®
—ÊÔ^ÓÃ¥Ç©`¥¿¤È¤·¤Æ£¬ÉÏÓ›¤ÇÕi¤ßÞz¤ó¤À—ÊÔ^ÓÃ¥Ç©`¥¿¤ÎImageDataGenerator¤òÖ¸¶¨¤·¤Þ¤¹£®

```
history = model.fit(
    train_data_gen_aug,
    epochs=10,
    validation_data=val_data_gen,
)
```

ÉÏÓ›×¢ÒâÊÂí—¤ÎÍ¨¤ê£¬—ÊÔ^ÓÃ¥Ç©`¥¿¤Ç¤ÎÐÔÄÜ¤ÏŒgëH¤ÎÐÔÄÜ¤è¤ê¤âÁ¼¤¯¤Ê¤Ã¤Æ¤¤¤ë¤ÈË¼¤ï¤ì¤ë¤¿¤á£¬µÃ¤é¤ì¤ë‚Ž¤òÐÅîm¤·¤Ê¤¤¤Û¤¦¤¬Á¼¤¤¤Ç¤¹£®

