# Description

English:??

This competition challenges participants to predict ?the arrival delay (in minutes) at the final station? of the high-speed train G77 service (""G77"" is the train ID). The training data consists of historical journey records for this specific train, detailing its schedule and performance at each station along its route between Beijing and Guangzhou South. The test data provides the scheduled information for a future journey of the same train service (G77) but omits the delay information at the final station (Guangzhou South). Competitors must build a model using the training data to predict the delay minutes upon arrival at Guangzhou South in the test data.

