    id, target
    A_2024-09-02_15_customers	0.2 
    A_2024-09-02_16_customers	0.3
    A_2024-09-02_17_customers	0.1
    A_2024-09-02_18_customers	0.8 

Each `id` is the unique combination of company name (anonymized), date, hour of the day, and type of the target (customers or revenue). The target values are scaled to lie in the interval [0, 1] for data privacy.","# Dataset Description

