Welcome to the 2025 KHUGGLE Competition.

Please find the competition information below

Develop knowledge distillation methods for image generation models (Diffusion).

Using a teacher DDPM model trained with more diffusion steps, design a training strategy that allows a smaller student DDPM model to be trained with fewer steps, while achieving performance comparable to the teacher.

¡ù Competition Schedule

- Start: 2025.11.24 13:00
- End: 2024.12.05 23:59
- Review: 2024.12.08 ~ 2024.12.12 (Private score + reproducibility check)
- Awards: Scheduled for 2024.12.23 ~ 27

