¡ù Competition Rules

1. You must strictly follow the following provided settings
(the organizers will reproduce your results using these settings):

- EPOCHS_OFFICIAL = 3
- BATCH_SIZE_OFFICIAL = 128
- LEARNING_RATE_OFFICIAL = 2e-4
- STEPS = [5 ~ 30] ¡ú you may choose the value within this range.

1. Both the student and teacher models must use the provided architecture and weights.
2. Your solution must be runnable on Google Colab.
(After the competition ends, you must submit your code as an .ipynb notebook, and it must be reproducible.)
3. If, after the competition ends, your results cannot be reproduced or the reported performance cannot be matched, your ranking will be invalidated.
4. You are limited to 10 submissions per day.


