10427,build-the-next-smilyai-llm,"# Overview

Overview
The Build Our Next LLM challenge is SmilyAI-Labs¡¯ open competition inviting creators to design the next breakthrough language model for our lab. Participants can use any architecture ¡ª Transformers, RNNs, CNNs, Mamba-style layers, hybrids, or completely original designs. The goal is simple: push MMLU performance as far as possible and show off your AI engineering skills.
The model with the highest verified MMLU score wins the competition, and the Top 10 models will be published under the official SmilyAI-Labs account with full credit to their creators. Submissions must include a submission.csv, a runnable notebook, a generation function, and a README.md.
If you¡¯re ready to build something bold, experimental, and genuinely impressive, this is your moment.
----------------------
# Description

## Build SmilyAI¡¯s Next LLM!
Think you can outsmart the competition? SmilyAI-Labs is hosting the **Build Our Next LLM** challenge ¡ª your chance to design a next-gen chatbot that could officially join our lineup.
You get full freedom to cook up whatever architecture you want:
Transformers, RNNs, CNNs, Mamba-style layers, hybrids, or something totally original that nobody¡¯s seen before. If it trains and produces results, you¡¯re in.
## Core challenge:
Try to beat the current MMLU  by **50% or more**.
And the **highest MMLU score** wins the entire competition.
##Winning perks:
Top 10 models get published under the SmilyAI-Labs account.
Full credit to every creator.
Your Kaggle + Hugging Face profiles linked right on each model¡¯s page.
And of course ¡ª the #1 model becomes our official next chatbot.
If you¡¯ve ever wanted your work showcased under a real AI lab, this is literally the perfect moment. Bring your wildest ideas, break old conventions, and push what an LLM can do.
----------------------
# Evaluation

Evaluation
