# Evaluation

It should be a 1 or a 0 depending if above or below the median.  It should have 100 precision and recall.","# Dataset Description

Gas mileage, horsepower, and other information for 392 vehicles.

A data frame with 392 observations on the following 9 variables.

mpg: miles per gallon

cylinders: Number of cylinders between 4 and 8

displacement: Engine displacement (cu. inches)

horsepower: Engine horsepower

weight: Vehicle weight (lbs.)

acceleration: Time to accelerate from 0 to 60 mph (sec.)

year: Model year (modulo 100)

origin: Origin of car (1. American, 2. European, 3. Japanese)

name: Vehicle name

Notes
This dataset was taken from the StatLib library which is maintained at Carnegie Mellon University. The dataset was used in the 1983 American Statistical Association Exposition. The original dataset has 397 observations, of which 5 have missing values for the variable horsepower. These rows are removed here. The original dataset is available at the book¡¯s website.

