# Description

In this competition, participants are provided with a dataset and tasked with developing a machine learning solution to solve the given problem. Using data preprocessing, feature engineering, and model training techniques, participants must generate predictions for the test dataset and submit them on Kaggle in the specified format. Submissions are evaluated using a standard performance metric, and participants are ranked on the leaderboard based on their model accuracy and efficiency. The competition is designed to assess analytical thinking, ML concepts, and implementation skills in a competitive environment.
