predicted_close ¡ª your predicted closing price for that date","# Dataset Description

The dataset provided in this competition contains historical stock data for the SPY ETF (S&P 500 Index ETF). The data is divided into training and test sets, and participants are expected to predict the closing prices for the test set based on the training data.

Training Data (train.csv):
The training dataset contains historical stock prices for the SPY ETF from January 1, 2020 to December 31, 2024. The features in the dataset are as follows:

Date: The date of the stock price observation (business days).

Open: The opening price of the stock on the given date.

High: The highest price of the stock on the given date.

Low: The lowest price of the stock on the given date.

Close: The closing price of the stock on the given date.

Volume: The trading volume of the stock on the given date.

Test Data (test.csv):
The test dataset contains stock data for the SPY ETF from January 1, 2025 to March 31, 2025. The dataset includes only the Date feature. Participants are expected to predict the Close price for each date in the test set. The format of the test dataset is as follows:

Date: The date for which predictions need to be made.

Submission Format (sample_submission.csv):
The submission file should include the predicted Close price for each date in the test set, formatted as follows:

Date: The date for the stock price prediction.

symbol: Always ""SPY"".",False,True
