# Evaluation

mAP@0.5 (Mean Average Precision at IoU = 0.5)

Based on the COCO evaluation framework, restricted to a single IoU threshold (0.5). Measures detection accuracy with moderate localization quality requirements. Perfect Score: 1.0 How mAP@0.5 Works IoU Calculation: For each prediction, compute Intersection over Union with each ground truth box Matching: A prediction with IoU ¡Ý 0.5 can match one ground truth (best match chosen). Extra predictions count as false positives Precision/Recall: Compute precision and recall over all confidence thresholds Average Precision: The area under the precision¨Crecall curve for each class Mean AP: The average of AP values across the 3 classes(Drone,AirPlane,Helicopter)

