Due to experimental cost and resource constraints, only a limited number of compounds can be synthesized and biologically tested. Your responsibility is to develop robust machine learning¨Cbased QSAR regression models that accurately predict compound bioactivity and enable data-driven compound prioritization at scale.

Your Role: You will function as computational medicinal chemists and drug discovery data scientists, tasked with:

