Cu?c thi s? d?ng ch? s? **RMSE (Root Mean Squared Error)** ?? ?¨¢nh gi¨¢ x?p h?ng. Ban t? ch?c khuy?n kh¨ªch th¨ª sinh n?p k?t qu? d??i d?ng s? th?c (**float**) ?? ??t ?? ch¨ªnh x¨¢c cao nh?t.

