# 02 ¡ª Deliverables

### ?? Challenge 02 ¡ª Deliverables

**From Messy Reality to Reproducible Trust**

In this stage, clarity and reproducibility matter more than complexity.
You¡¯ll produce a complete, auditable record showing **how messy data became trustworthy data** ¡ª from raw audit logs to the final validation report.

