T¨¢c v? 1: D? ?O¨¢N CH? S? B?I M?N PM2.5 Ch? s? PM2.5 l¨¤ ch? s? quan tr?ng ???c s? d?ng ?? ?¨¢nh gi¨¢ ch?t l??ng kh?ng kh¨ª. N?ng ?? PM2.5 c¨¤ng cao th¨¬ ch?t l??ng kh?ng kh¨ª c¨¤ng suy gi?m, gay ?nh h??ng t?i ???ng h? h?p v¨¤ s?c kh?e con ng??i. Do ?¨®, vi?c thu th?p d? li?u v¨¤ d? b¨¢o ch? s? PM2.5 l¨¤ v? c¨´ng c?n thi?t. Tuy nhi¨ºn, do chi ph¨ª v¨¤ ??a h¨¬nh, nhi?u khu v?c kh?ng th? ??t c¨¢c thi?t b? ?? thu th?p d? li?u PM2.5. V¨¬ v?y, ch? ?? c?a cu?c thi l¨¤ D? b¨¢o ch? s? PM2.5 d?a tr¨ºn m?t s? ch? s? kh¨¢c.
----------------------
# Description

# M? t? Nhi?m v? (Task Description)

### 1. Nhi?m v? ch¨ªnh
Trong t¨¢c v? n¨¤y, nhi?m v? c?a c¨¢c ??i thi l¨¤ **d? b¨¢o ch? s? PM2.5**.

C¨¢c ??i s? s? d?ng b? d? li?u do Ban t? ch?c (BTC) cung c?p ?? hu?n luy?n m? h¨¬nh. 
* **Input (??u v¨¤o):** G?m c¨¢c ch? s? PM10, NO, NO2, NOx, NH3, CO, SO2, O3, Benzene, Toluene, Xylen.
* **Target (??u ra):** Ch? s? PM2.5.

Sau khi hu?n luy?n, m? h¨¬nh s? ???c ch?y tr¨ºn **b? d? li?u test** (ch? g?m th?ng tin ??u v¨¤o). C¨¢c ??i c?n n?p k?t qu? d? ?o¨¢n (PM2.5) l¨ºn h? th?ng ?? ch?m ?i?m.

---

### 2. C?u tr¨²c d? li?u
M?i b? d? li?u l¨¤ 1 file `.csv` bao g?m **14 c?t**:

* **C?t 1:** StationId (T¨ºn tr?m ?o).
* **C?t 2:** Datetime (Th?i gian l?y m?u).
* **C?t 3 - 13:** C¨¢c gi¨¢ tr? ??u v¨¤o (Features).
* **C?t 14:** Gi¨¢ tr? ??u ra PM2.5 (ch? c¨® trong t?p Train).

### 3. V¨ª d? m?u d? li?u

<pre><code>StationId,Datetime,PM10,NO,NO2,NOx,NH3,CO,SO2,O3,Benzene,Toluene,Xylene,PM2.5
BR007,2015-06-01 15:00:00,158.48,2.11,7.16,8.01,28.71,1.01,2.72,8.47,0.00,0.71,0.00,80.86
BR007,2015-06-01 16:00:00,158.48,26.47,27.17,53.65,28.71,1.31,2.01,8.92,0.00,0.08,0.00,80.86</code></pre>
----------------------
# Evaluation

### Ti¨ºu ch¨ª ?¨¢nh gi¨¢

K?t qu? s? ???c ?¨¢nh gi¨¢ d?a tr¨ºn ch? s? **MAPE (Mean Absolute Percentage Error)**. MAPE l¨¤ ti¨ºu ch¨ª ?¨¢nh gi¨¢ ch¨ªnh hi?u su?t c?a m? h¨¬nh. MAPE l¨¤ sai s? ph?n tr?m tuy?t ??i trung b¨¬nh. MAPE c¨¤ng nh? th¨¬ m? h¨¬nh c¨¤ng hi?u qu?.

MAPE ???c t¨ªnh theo c?ng th?c:

$$\text{MAPE} = \frac{\displaystyle\sum \frac{|A - F|}{A} \times 100}{N}$$

**Trong ?¨®:**

