- `sadness` ¨C bu?n b?, th?t v?ng
- `surprise` ¨C ng?c nhi¨ºn
- `other` ¨C trung t¨ªnh ho?c c?m x¨²c kh¨¢c

L?u y:

- M?i comment ch? c¨® m?t nh?n
- `other` bao g?m comment kh?ng bi?u ??t c?m x¨²c r? r¨¤ng

## ??c ?i?m d? li?u

Comment mang t¨ªnh t? nhi¨ºn v¨¤ c¨® th? ch?a:
- T? vi?t t?t / ti?ng l¨®ng
- Emoji / ky t? ??c bi?t
- L?i ch¨ªnh t?
- Bi?u ??t c?m x¨²c gi¨¢n ti?p
----------------------
# ?¨¢nh gi¨¢

K?t qu? ???c ?¨¢nh gi¨¢ b?ng ch? s? **F1 Score (Macro F1)** v?i:
- **True Positive (TP)**: D? ?o¨¢n ?¨²ng nh?n ?¨®.
- **False Positive (FP)**: D? ?o¨¢n l¨¤ nh?n ?¨® nh?ng th?c t? kh?ng ph?i.
- **False Negative (FN)**: Th?c t? l¨¤ nh?n ?¨® nh?ng m? h¨¬nh kh?ng d? ?o¨¢n ?¨²ng.
- **Precision**: Trong t?t c? c¨¢c comment m¨¤ m? h¨¬nh d? ?o¨¢n thu?c v? 1 nh?n, c¨® bao nhi¨ºu comment th?c s? ?¨²ng.
$$
Precision = \frac{TP}{TP + FP}
$$
- **Recall**: Trong t?t c? c¨¢c comment th?c s? thu?c v? 1 nh?n, m? h¨¬nh nh?n di?n ?¨²ng ???c bao nhi¨ºu.
$$
Recall = \frac{TP}{TP + FN}
$$
- **F1 Score**: can b?ng gi?a Precision v¨¤ Recall.
$$
F1 = \frac{2 \times Precision \times Recall}{Precision + Recall} = \frac{2TP}{2TP + FP + FN}
$$
- **Macro F1 Score**:
$$
Macro\ F1 = \frac{F1_{anger} + F1_{disgust} + F1_{enjoyment} + F1_{fear} + F1_{sadness} + F1_{surprise} + F1_{other}}{7}
$$

B?ng x?p h?ng s? ???c s?p x?p t? tr¨ºn xu?ng d??i theo th? t? gi?m d?n d?a tr¨ºn **Macro F1 Score**.

# Quy c¨¢ch n?p b¨¤i
