## D? li?u
Ban t? ch?c cung c?p hai th¨¤nh ph?n d? li?u ch¨ªnh:
- **train.csv** ¨C T?p hu?n luy?n (c¨® nh?n)
- **test.csv** ¨C T?p ki?m th? (kh?ng c¨® nh?n)

## M? t? d? li?u

M?i m?u d? li?u t??ng ?ng v?i m?t comment ti?ng Vi?t ???c thu th?p t? n?n t?ng m?ng x? h?i.

### C?u tr¨²c d? li?u:
