10862,alchemy-aicc-round-4-old,"# Overview

This competition is organized by the [IOAI Community Contest group](https://ioai-community-contest.netlify.app/) (not affiliated with IOAI), which is made up of IOAI alumni. It is meant to prepare students for the IOAI (International Olympiad in Artificial Intelligence).
----------------------
# Description

## 1. Problem Description

In the game Little Alchemy, players combine elements to discover new ones. Fire and water make steam. Earth and seeds make a tree. Some combinations are intuitive, others require creativity, dinosaur plus fire becomes a dragon.

You are given a dataset of 150 training combination rules (`item1 + item2 ¡ú result`) and 70 test pairs with hidden results. Your job is to predict which result belongs to each test pair.

## 2. Dataset

```
data/
©À©¤©¤ train.csv       # 150 rows: item1, item2, result
©À©¤©¤ test.csv        # 70 rows: Id, item1, item2 (target hidden)
©¸©¤©¤ candidates.csv  # 70 rows: result (unique candidate labels)
```

- **Training set:** 150 labeled examples
- **Test set:** 70 pairs to predict
- **Candidates:** The list of 70 possible results for the test set
- All items are lowercase English words or short phrases
- The assignment is bijective, each test pair maps to exactly one unique candidate, and each candidate is used once.

![Alchemy Combination Example](https://imgur.com/bWlfm5A.png) 

## 3. Task

For each of the 70 test pairs, predict the correct result from the candidate list.

**Constraint:** You may only use `bert-base-uncased`, no other pretrained models or external data allowed.
----------------------
# Evaluation

## 4. Submission

Submit a CSV with columns `Id` and `result`:

```python
import pandas as pd

submission = pd.DataFrame({
    'Id': test_df['Id'],
    'result': predictions
})
submission.to_csv('submission.csv', index=False)
```

## 5. Score

Accuracy: fraction of correct assignments.

$$ \text{Accuracy} = \frac{\text{Number of Correct Predictions}}{70} $$

- **Baseline Score:** ~0.08
- **Reference Solution Score:** ~0.41

The baseline can be found on the **[Code](https://www.kaggle.com/code/antoningorokva/baseline-alchemy-aicc-round-4)** section of this competition or in Google Colab [Here](https://colab.research.google.com/#fileId=https%3A//storage.googleapis.com/kaggle-colab-exported-notebooks/antoningorokva/baseline-alchemy-aicc-round-4.fedbf9a4-dcae-41e7-8d23-4fd53d64eb73.ipynb%3FX-Goog-Algorithm%3DGOOG4-RSA-SHA256%26X-Goog-Credential%3Dgcp-kaggle-com%2540kaggle-161607.iam.gserviceaccount.com/20260219/auto/storage/goog4_request%26X-Goog-Date%3D20260219T205732Z%26X-Goog-Expires%3D259200%26X-Goog-SignedHeaders%3Dhost%26X-Goog-Signature%)","# Dataset Description

```
data/
©À©¤©¤ train.csv       # 150 rows: item1, item2, result
©À©¤©¤ test.csv        # 70 rows: Id, item1, item2
©¸©¤©¤ candidates.csv  # 70 rows: result (unique candidate labels)
```

- **Training set:** 150 labeled examples
- **Test set:** 70 pairs to predict
- **Candidates:** The list of 70 possible results for the test set
- All items are lowercase English words or short phrases
- The assignment is bijective, each test pair maps to exactly one unique candidate, and each candidate is used once.",False,True
10863,hamic-new-year-2026-algo-task,"# Overview

Trong c¨¢c h? th?ng logistics v¨¤ v?n t?i hi?n ??i, doanh nghi?p th??ng ph?i x? ly ??ng th?i nhi?u ??n h¨¤ng v?i y¨ºu c?u nh?n v¨¤ giao t?i c¨¢c v? tr¨ª kh¨¢c nhau. Vi?c l?p k? ho?ch l? tr¨¬nh hi?u qu? cho ??i xe, ??c bi?t khi c¨¢c ph??ng ti?n c¨® t?i tr?ng v¨¤ chi ph¨ª v?n h¨¤nh kh¨¢c nhau, l¨¤ m?t b¨¤i to¨¢n t?i ?u quan tr?ng trong l?nh v?c thu?t to¨¢n v¨¤ nghi¨ºn c?u v?n tr¨´ h?c.

**Nhi?m v?:**

Xay d?ng thu?t to¨¢n gi?i b¨¤i to¨¢n **Pickup & Delivery Problem v?i ??i xe kh?ng ??ng nh?t (Heterogeneous Fleet PDP-VRP)**.

M?i ??n h¨¤ng bao g?m m?t ?i?m nh?n (Pickup) v¨¤ m?t ?i?m giao (Delivery). Thu?t to¨¢n c?n quy?t ??nh:
- Phan c?ng ??n h¨¤ng cho xe ph¨´ h?p
- Xay d?ng l? tr¨¬nh di chuy?n cho t?ng xe

Sao cho **t?ng chi ph¨ª v?n chuy?n l¨¤ t?i ?u nh?t**.

B¨¤i to¨¢n thu?c nh¨®m **Combinatorial Optimization / Vehicle Routing Problem (VRP)** v?i c¨¢c r¨¤ng bu?c th?c t? nh? t?i tr?ng, th? t? nh?n-giao v¨¤ t¨ªnh nh?t qu¨¢n ph??ng ti?n.

**Chi ti?t to¨¤n b? chu?i cu?c thi: [HAMIC New Year 2026 Challenge](https://github.com/HaianCao/HAMIC_New_Year_2026_Challenge)**
----------------------
# Description

# 1. M? t? b¨¤i to¨¢n
## ??nh ngh?a B¨¤i to¨¢n

B¨¤i to¨¢n thu?c l?p **Pickup & Delivery Problem with Heterogeneous Fleet (PDP-HF)**.

H? th?ng g?m c¨¢c th¨¤nh ph?n sau:

### a. Fleet (??i xe)

T?p xe \\( V = \{v_1, v_2, ..., v_m\} \\)

M?i xe \\( v \\) c¨® thu?c t¨ªnh:

- \\( Capacity_v \\) ¨C T?i tr?ng t?i ?a  
- \\( Price_v \\) ¨C Chi ph¨ª tr¨ºn m?i ??n v? qu?ng ???ng  
- \\( Start_v = (x_v, y_v) \\) ¨C T?a ?? xu?t ph¨¢t  

### b. Orders (??n h¨¤ng)

T?p ??n h¨¤ng \\( O = \{o_1, o_2, ..., o_n\} \\)

M?i ??n h¨¤ng \\( o_i \\) c¨®:

- \\( Weight_i \\) ¨C Kh?i l??ng h¨¤ng  
- \\( Pickup_i = (p^x_i, p^y_i) \\) ¨C ?i?m nh?n  
- \\( Delivery_i = (d^x_i, d^y_i) \\) ¨C ?i?m giao  

### c. Distance Function (H¨¤m kho?ng c¨¢ch)

Kho?ng c¨¢ch Euclidean gi?a hai ?i?m \\( A(x_1, y_1) \\), \\( B(x_2, y_2) \\):

$$
dist(A, B) = \sqrt{(x_1 - x_2)^2 + (y_1 - y_2)^2}
$$

## Ph¨¢t bi?u B¨¤i to¨¢n

Y¨ºu c?u xay d?ng l? tr¨¬nh cho to¨¤n b? ??i xe sao cho:

- M?i ??n h¨¤ng ???c ph?c v? h?p l?  
- Kh?ng vi ph?m r¨¤ng bu?c v?n h¨¤nh  
- T?ng chi ph¨ª nh? nh?t  

Chi ph¨ª c?a m?t xe \\( v \\):

$$
Cost_v = TotalDistance_v \times Price_v
$$

T?ng chi ph¨ª h? th?ng:

$$
TotalCost = \sum_{v \in V} Cost_v
$$

M?c ti¨ºu t?i ?u:

$$
\min TotalCost
$$

## R¨¤ng bu?c B¨¤i to¨¢n (Constraints)

### a. Capacity Constraint

T?i m?i b??c trong l? tr¨¬nh c?a xe, t?i tr?ng kh?ng ???c v??t qu¨¢ t?i tr?ng t?i ?a:

$$
Load_v(k) \le Capacity_v
$$

Trong ?¨® \\(k\\) l¨¤ th? t? thao t¨¢c trong l? tr¨¬nh c?a xe \\(v\\).

### b. Pickup¨CDelivery Precedence

M?i ??n h¨¤ng ph?i ???c nh?n tr??c khi giao:

$$
Position(Pickup_i) < Position(Delivery_i)
$$

Trong ?¨® \\(Position(\cdot)\\) l¨¤ ch? s? thao t¨¢c trong l? tr¨¬nh.

### c. Completeness Constraint

M?i ??n h¨¤ng ph?i ???c ph?c v? ??y ??:

$$
count(Pickup_i) = 1 \land count(Delivery_i) = 1
$$

### d. Ownership Constraint

??n h¨¤ng kh?ng ???c trung chuy?n gi?a c¨¢c xe.

Xe n¨¤o th?c hi?n Pickup c?a ??n h¨¤ng th¨¬ ch¨ªnh xe ?¨® ph?i th?c hi?n Delivery.

$$
Vehicle(Pickup_i) = Vehicle(Delivery_i)
$$

### e. Load Consistency

T?i tr?ng c?a xe ph?i ???c c?p nh?t ch¨ªnh x¨¢c sau m?i thao t¨¢c.

- Sau Pickup: \\(Load \leftarrow Load + Weight_i\\)
- Sau Delivery: \\(Load \leftarrow Load - Weight_i\\)

T?i m?i th?i ?i?m:

$$
Load_{v}(t) \ge 0
$$

?i?u n¨¤y ??m b?o xe kh?ng th? giao h¨¤ng khi kh?ng c¨® h¨¤ng tr¨ºn xe.

### f. Consistency Constraint

M?i tham chi?u trong file l?i gi?i ph?i h?p l?:

- \\(Vehicle\_{ID} \in V_t\\)
- \\(Order\_{ID} \in O_t\\)

Kh?ng ???c s? d?ng ID kh?ng t?n t?i trong Test Case t??ng ?ng.

### g. Action Validity

C¨¢c thao t¨¢c tr¨ºn ??n h¨¤ng ph?i h?p l? v¨¤ kh?ng ???c mau thu?n logic.

Kh?ng ???c ph¨¦p:

- Pickup tr¨´ng l?p cho c¨´ng m?t Order
- Delivery tr¨´ng l?p cho c¨´ng m?t Order
- Delivery khi ch?a Pickup

## ?i?u ki?n nghi?m h?p l?

M?t nghi?m h?p l? khi:

- Bao ph? to¨¤n b? t?p \\( O \\)  
- Th?a m?n m?i r¨¤ng bu?c  
- ?¨²ng ??nh d?ng Output


# 2. D? li?u

D? li?u bao g?m c¨¢c ph??ng ti?n v?n chuy?n v¨¤ c¨¢c ??n h¨¤ng c?n th?c hi?n.

M?i Test Case g?m hai th¨¤nh ph?n ch¨ªnh:

### 1. Vehicle (??i xe)
M?i ph??ng ti?n c¨® c¨¢c thu?c t¨ªnh:
- `ID`: ??nh danh xe
- `Capacity`: T?i tr?ng t?i ?a
- `Price`: ??n gi¨¢ theo qu?ng ???ng
- `Start_X`, `Start_Y`: T?a ?? xu?t ph¨¢t

### 2. Order (??n h¨¤ng)
M?i ??n h¨¤ng bao g?m:
- `ID`: ??nh danh ??n h¨¤ng
- `Weight`: Kh?i l??ng h¨¤ng h¨®a
- `Pickup_X`, `Pickup_Y`: T?a ?? nh?n h¨¤ng
- `Delivery_X`, `Delivery_Y`: T?a ?? giao h¨¤ng

## ??c ?i?m d? li?u

B¨¤i to¨¢n mang t¨ªnh t? h?p v¨¤ ph?n ¨¢nh c¨¢c ?i?u ki?n v?n t?i th?c t?:
- ??i xe **kh?ng ??ng nh?t** (kh¨¢c t?i tr?ng & chi ph¨ª)
- M?i ??n h¨¤ng c¨® **hai ?i?m r¨¤ng bu?c**: Pickup & Delivery
- Phan b? kh?ng gian theo t?a ?? 2D (Euclidean space)
- S? l??ng xe v¨¤ ??n h¨¤ng thay ??i theo Test Case
----------------------
# ?¨¢nh gi¨¢

K?t qu? ???c ?¨¢nh gi¨¢ b?ng ch? s? **Mean Efficiency Score (MES)**

V?i m?i Test Case \\(t\\):

- **T?ng chi ph¨ª th?c t?**

$$
TotalCost_t =
\sum_{v \in V_t}
\big(
TotalDistance_{v,t} \times Price_v
\big)
$$

- **C?n d??i ly t??ng**

$$
LowerBound_t =
\sum_{i \in O_t}
\big(
dist(Pickup_i, Delivery_i) \times Price_{\min,t}
\big)
$$

Trong ?¨®:

$$
Price_{\min,t} = \min_{v \in V_t}(Price_v)
$$

- **Efficiency Score c?a Test \\(t\\)**

$$
ES_t =
\frac{TotalCost_t}{LowerBound_t}
$$

### Mean Efficiency Score

$$
MES =
\frac{1}{T}
\sum_{t=1}^{T} ES_t
$$

**Ky hi?u s? d?ng**

- \\(V_t\\) ¨C T?p xe trong Test \\(t\\)  
- \\(O_t\\) ¨C T?p ??n h¨¤ng trong Test \\(t\\)  
- \\(TotalDistance_{v,t}\\) ¨C T?ng qu?ng ???ng xe \\(v\\) di chuy?n trong Test \\(t\\)  
- \\(Price_v\\) ¨C ??n gi¨¢ theo qu?ng ???ng c?a xe \\(v\\)  
- \\(Pickup_i\\), \\(Delivery_i\\) ¨C T?a ?? Pickup v¨¤ Delivery c?a Order \\(i\\)  
- \\(T\\) ¨C S? l??ng Test Case  

B?ng x?p h?ng s? ???c s?p x?p t? tr¨ºn xu?ng d??i theo th? t? t?ng d?n d?a tr¨ºn **MES**

## Quy c¨¢ch n?p b¨¤i

File n?p b¨¤i ph?i ? ??nh d?ng CSV:
```
ID,Test,Vehicle_ID,Order_ID,Type,Stop_Order
1,1,V001,O001,Pickup,1
2,1,V001,O001,Delivery,2
3,2,V003,O010,Pickup,1
4,2,V003,O010,Delivery,2
```
**Quy t?c b?t bu?c**
