## MTF VLM Challenge Dataset - Synthetic Split

### Overview

This dataset is part of the training data for the **CVPR Workshop Metafood VLM Challenge**. It consists of image-text pairs where the images are synthetically generated using **[Stable Diffusion 2.1](https://huggingface.co/stabilityai/stable-diffusion-2-1)**.

The dataset has been carefully curated using the **Precision-at-Scale** method, ensuring high relevance and quality for domain-specific tasks.

**Associated Hugging Face Repository:** `jesusmolrdv/MTF25-VLM-Challenge-Dataset-Synth`

### Dataset Description

* **Source:** Synthetic images generated via Stable Diffusion v2.1.
* **Format:** The dataset hosted on Hugging Face contains a table (similar to a Pandas DataFrame or Hugging Face `Dataset` object) with two columns:
    * `image`: The PIL (Python Imaging Library) image object itself.
    * `caption`: The textual description (prompt) used to generate the image.
* **Curation:** The selection/generation process was guided by the methodology described in the ""Precision at Scale"" paper (see Citation section).

