Innovation & originality

Technical quality

Real-world usefulness

Clarity of documentation
----------------------
# Description

?? Understanding Human Intelligence in Crisis Situations

Crisis situations ¡ª such as natural disasters, medical emergencies, financial shocks, conflicts, and high-risk operations ¡ª place extreme pressure on human decision-making. Under stress, individuals may experience cognitive overload, emotional bias, and time-constrained thinking, which can significantly impact outcomes.

This hackathon explores how human intelligence changes under pressure and invites participants to design solutions that help individuals and organizations make better decisions in high-stress environments.

?? Challenge Goals

Participants are encouraged to build tools, models, or research insights that:

