Stress detection using behavioral signals

Human performance monitoring tools

Cognitive load estimation systems

?? Crisis Response & Preparedness

Emergency response optimization tools

Real-time situational awareness dashboards

Resource allocation decision systems

?? Research & Insights

Behavioral analysis using public datasets

Studies on decision-making under pressure

AI-driven human behavior insights

?? Acceptable Technologies

Participants may use:

? Machine Learning & Deep Learning
? Behavioral analytics techniques
? Generative AI & LLMs
? Data visualization tools
? Simulation & modeling approaches

?? Submission Requirements

